sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Analyst as Payment Operations Analyst
  participant AI as AI Copilot
  participant GW as Governed MCP Gateway (target)
  participant Adapter as Bank Read-only Adapter (target)
  participant Hub as Payment Hub / Archive
  participant MCP as FEI MCP Tool Server
  participant Core as Deterministic Evidence Engine
  Analyst->>AI: Why was payment REF123 rejected?
  AI->>GW: get_payment_evidence(REF123) [proposed]
  GW->>GW: Authenticate + authorize + audit + scope
  GW->>Adapter: Authorized minimum-data query
  Adapter->>Hub: Read original and status message
  Hub-->>Adapter: pacs.008 + pacs.002 with source IDs
  Adapter-->>AI: Authorized / minimized evidence
  AI->>MCP: validate_message(original)
  MCP->>Core: Deterministic validation
  Core-->>MCP: Business/schema/security findings
  AI->>MCP: investigate_payment(original,status)
  MCP->>Core: Correlate OrgnlMsgId and transaction IDs
  Core-->>MCP: Matched or unknown, codes, cited XML paths
  MCP-->>AI: Read-only evidence, uncertainty, human review
  AI-->>Analyst: Explain bank-reported facts; no automatic retry
  Note over AI,Core: Currently working locally with supplied XML; bank access is future scope
